# 高频词汇 List04
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023恋练有词
# 描述: 高频词汇List04核心词汇

{{perspective}}{/pəˈspektɪv/}{观点；视角}{Let's look at this problem from a different perspective.}}
{{phenomenon}}{/fɪˈnɒmɪnən/}{现象；非凡的人或事}{Globalization is a complex phenomenon.}}
{{philosophy}}{/fɪˈlɒsəfi/}{哲学；理念}{His teaching philosophy centers on student engagement.}}
{{policy}}{/ˈpɒləsi/}{政策；方针}{The government introduced a new education policy.}}
{{positive}}{/ˈpɒzətɪv/}{积极的；肯定的}{Try to maintain a positive attitude during difficult times.}}
{{potential}}{/pəˈtenʃl/}{潜力；潜在的}{Every student has the potential to succeed.}}
{{poverty}}{/ˈpɒvəti/}{贫穷；贫困}{Millions of people still live in poverty.}}
{{predict}}{/prɪˈdɪkt/}{预测；预言}{It is difficult to predict the outcome of the election.}}
{{preserve}}{/prɪˈzɜːv/}{保护；保存}{We must preserve our cultural heritage.}}
{{previous}}{/ˈpriːviəs/}{以前的；先前的}{She had no previous experience in this field.}}
{{primary}}{/ˈpraɪməri/}{主要的；初级的}{The primary goal of education is to develop critical thinking.}}
{{principle}}{/ˈprɪnsəpl/}{原则；原理}{The experiment is based on a simple principle of physics.}}
{{priority}}{/praɪˈɒrəti/}{优先事项；重点}{Safety should always be the top priority.}}
{{privilege}}{/ˈprɪvəlɪdʒ/}{特权；荣幸}{Education is a right, not a privilege.}}
{{proceed}}{/prəˈsiːd/}{继续；进行}{After the break, the meeting proceeded as planned.}}
{{process}}{/ˈprəʊses/}{过程；处理}{Learning a language is a gradual process.}}
{{produce}}{/prəˈdjuːs/}{生产；产生}{The factory produces electronic components.}}
{{professional}}{/prəˈfeʃənl/}{专业的；职业人员}{She is a highly respected professional in her field.}}
{{profit}}{/ˈprɒfɪt/}{利润；利益}{The company reported record profits this year.}}
{{profound}}{/prəˈfaʊnd/}{深刻的；深远的}{The experience had a profound effect on her outlook.}}
{{progress}}{/ˈprəʊɡres/}{进步；进展}{Significant progress has been made in cancer research.}}
{{project}}{/ˈprɒdʒekt/}{项目；投射}{The construction project will take two years to complete.}}
{{promote}}{/prəˈməʊt/}{促进；推广}{The campaign aims to promote healthy eating habits.}}
{{property}}{/ˈprɒpəti/}{财产；性质；房地产}{Intellectual property rights protect inventors.}}
{{proportion}}{/prəˈpɔːʃn/}{比例；部分}{A large proportion of the population lives in urban areas.}}
{{propose}}{/prəˈpəʊz/}{提议；建议}{The committee proposed a new plan for urban development.}}
{{prospect}}{/ˈprɒspekt/}{前景；展望}{The job prospects for graduates are improving.}}
{{protest}}{/prəˈtest/}{抗议；反对}{Thousands joined the protest against the new law.}}
{{provide}}{/prəˈvaɪd/}{提供；供给}{The scholarship provides financial support for students.}}
{{pursue}}{/pəˈsjuː/}{追求；追赶}{She decided to pursue a career in medicine.}
